@startuml avs-reference-architecture
title AVS Reference Architecture ; Six Planes (CR-VAS-008)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "P1\nValue & Outcome\nPlane" as P1
rectangle "P2\nValue Stream\nRealization Plane" as P2
rectangle "P3\nAgentic\nParticipation Plane" as P3
rectangle "P4\nControl &\nGovernance Plane" as P4
rectangle "P5\nKnowledge &\nContext Plane" as P5
rectangle "P6\nTechnology &\nIntegration Plane" as P6

P1 -> P2
P2 -> P3
P3 -> P4
P4 -> P5
P5 -> P6

note right of P6
  Technology is realization
  infrastructure, not AVS
  semantics.
end note

note left of P1
  P1 is the business anchor.
  P6 stays at the bottom of
  the semantic dependency chain.
end note

@enduml
